#. type: Title #
#: docs/guide/database.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "PostgreSQL Setup and Operations"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> FreeAnima uses PostgreSQL for conversation archives, semantic memory, self layer, and related data.\n"
"> Related concepts: [`memory.md`](../concepts/memory.md), [`sleep.md`](../concepts/sleep.md).\n"
"> Security and credentials: [`security.md`](security.md).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/database.md:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connection Configuration"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:14
msgid "Set the database URL in `config.yaml`:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/guide/database.md:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"database:\n"
"  url: postgresql://user:pass@localhost:5432/anima\n"
"  # or use credential():\n"
"  # url: credential(\"services/postgres/anima\", \"url\")\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:23
msgid ""
"Production **must** set `database.url`. Prefer pass for passwords instead of "
"plaintext in config. Path conventions: [`security.md`]"
"(security.md#credential-responsibilities)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/database.md:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Local Install (Debian)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/database.md:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Install PostgreSQL, create anima db/user (requires sudo)\n"
"sudo ./scripts/setup-postgres-debian.sh\n"
"\n"
"# Write credentials to pass (script prints anima credential add …)\n"
"anima credential add services/postgres/anima url=… host=… password=… database=anima\n"
"\n"
"# config.yaml:\n"
"#   url: credential(\"services/postgres/anima\", \"url\")\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:38
msgid ""
"Defaults: PostgreSQL 17, `localhost` only, `scram-sha-256`, dedicated "
"`anima` database and user."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/database.md:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "Extensions (One-Time)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:42
msgid ""
"Full-text and vector search require PostgreSQL extensions. The app user "
"usually cannot `CREATE EXTENSION`; run as superuser:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/database.md:43
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo apt install postgresql-17-pgvector   # match psql --version\n"
"sudo -u postgres psql -d anima -f core/scripts/ensure-pg-extensions.sql\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:49
msgid ""
"Fresh Debian installs via `setup-postgres-debian.sh` handle extensions "
"automatically."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/database.md:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "Schema Migrations"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/database.md:54
msgid ""
"**Production (recommended):** When PostgreSQL is configured, `anima service` "
"**auto-applies** pending schema migrations on startup."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/database.md:54
msgid "**Manual:**"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/database.md:55
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"DATABASE_URL=\"$(anima credential get services/postgres/anima url)\" \\\n"
"  bun run --filter @freeanima/core/db db:migrate\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:61
msgid "Run after extensions are installed, or restart `anima service`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/database.md:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "`auto_llm_runs` (audit)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:65
msgid ""
"Background LLM without user turns (cron agent, sleep pipeline stages) writes "
"to `auto_llm_runs` instead of creating `sessions`. Retention (optional "
"`config.yaml`):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/guide/database.md:66
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"auto_llm:\n"
"  retention_days: 30\n"
"  per_run_kind_keep: 100\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:73
msgid ""
"Purged during sleep-cycle step `conversation-cleanup` (after stale "
"conversation cleanup). Cron script runs (`no_agent`) use `cron_log` only."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/database.md:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "Backups"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/database.md:79
msgid ""
"**Migrations do not replace backups** — schedule regular full backups (e.g. "
"`pg_dump`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/database.md:79
msgid "Back up before destructive changes."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/database.md:79
msgid ""
"Include `~/.anima/` (`FREEANIMA_HOME` overridable) in backup policy — see "
"[`security.md`](security.md#data-persistence)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/database.md:80
#, no-wrap
msgid "Integration Tests (Developers)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:83
msgid ""
"Full integration tests require **Docker** for a temporary PostgreSQL "
"instance:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/database.md:84
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"bun run test:integration\n"
"bun run test              # unit + integration in parallel\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:90
msgid "pre-commit `test:changed` does **not** run integration tests."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:98
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Symptom                     | Check                                                          |\n"
"| --------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Service fails on DB connect | `database.url`; PostgreSQL running; pass credentials readable  |\n"
"| Migration fails             | Extensions installed; DB user has DDL privileges               |\n"
"| FTS / vector recall empty   | `ensure-pg-extensions.sql` applied; `embedding` config enabled |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:99
msgid "More deployment security: [`security.md`](security.md)."
msgstr ""
